        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi naAroni mwituŋa daEjipitu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Kakweji aka kudenu kakekalaŋa kakweji kakusambila hatukweji twejima; kakekalaŋa kakweji kokakutachika nachu mwaka wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshenuna chipompelu chawaIsarela chejima, nenu, Hefuku damwikumi dakakwejikanu amayala ejima akakwati iwu mwana kamukoku, iwu mwana kamukoku, mwahita matala awatata jawu, mwana kamukoku hetala, mwana kamukokuhetala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi akwetala dimu akakeha, kushikila mukudya mwana kamukokunehi, mukwetala akabombi mwana kamukoku wumu namukwawuwukweti itala dadikuma nayena, akeseki mwaka chindi lawu antu; mwakeseki mwadi ilaŋawu antu ejima kulonda mwaka chindi mwakadi ilawu mwana kamukoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kamukoku wenu chiŋa wakabula hatamayi, weyalawamwaka wakusambila; mwakamukwati hela hadi anyikoku hela hadi ampembi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakamuhembi ho-o, nimwifuku dekumi nakawana dakakweji kokamu; antu ejima amuchipompelu chawaIsarela akamujahi namelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanoni mashi, akasampwili kuyipamba yakuchisu yamumbadi Kulotuyiyedi, nihachipamba chahewulu, kumatala kumwa kamudiila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbŋi akayidyi nawufuku wowenowu, yakutunjika kukesi, akayidyi namankendi akadi iluŋi i akayidyi namafu alula nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakayidya yayisu, helayakuteleka namejuku, chiŋa yakutunjika kukesi hohu; ninamutu windi, niyidi yindi, niyamwivumu dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakayishiyahu yakashika nikubudiduku, kwinza yakashalahu yakashika nikubudidi chiŋa mwakayochimukesi bwi chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya mumwaka mudiila; mwakadyi iku mwapimpila dehi mahinenu, mwavwala dehi nkwabilu kunyendu yenu, mwakwata dehi ninyitondu yenu kumakasa; mwakadyi chalufuchi hohu; hipaseka yaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami nakahita mwituŋa daEjipitu wufuku wowenowu, nakatapa anyana awedi ejima mwituŋa daEjipitu, ni awantu, ni awanyama; nakasompesha nakubabesha akishi ejima amuEjipitu; yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mashi akekali chinjikijilu chenu hamatalenu imwakekala; chinaka monamashi nakawutama hadenu, china kababesha ituŋa daEjipitu, hadenuhihakekala chipupu chakuyijilumunaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku denodu dakekali ifuku denu dakwanukisha nachu, mwakadihe mbaŋa nakudi ilamu chawija chaYehova; chanyaka yejima mwamba kavwali kila ŋawu anyanenu, akadihembi dakudiilamu chawija chachidika chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadyaŋa mankendi akadi iluŋi mafuku atanu nayedi; hefuku dakusambila mwakafumishi iluŋi mumatalenu; yowumuntu wakadya dinkendi dikweti iluŋi kufumisha hefuku dakusambila nakushi kŋi kwifuku damu chitanu nachiyedi, yena muntu owu akamufu mishimudi aIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku dakusambila dakekali ifuku denu dakupompa kwajila, nidamu chitanu nachiyedi dakekali dakupompa kwajila; hiyakakoŋela mwoku mudimu hela wanka hela wantaku, enu kukoŋamudimu chiŋa wakudya kwenu wejima wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka anukaŋa chachiwahi ifuku dachawija chamankendi akadi iluŋi; muloŋa denodu ifuku didunafumishili mazaza awantu enu ejima mwituŋa daEjipitu; dichi mwaka anukaŋa chachiwahi ifuku denodu kunyaka yejima yamba kavwali kila ŋawu anyanenu, hichidika chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakakweji kakusambila, hefukuda kakweji dekumi nakawana hamelela, mwakadyi mankendi akadi iluŋi, mwakayidyaŋa hohu nakushi kŋi kwifuku dakakweji damakumi ayedi nakamu, hamelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku atanu nayedi himwaka mwekanaŋa iluŋimu matalenuku; yenowu muntu wakadya yikweti iluŋi, akamu fumishimu chipompelu chawaIsarela, hela himwenyi hela himukwa kuvwalika mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakadyahu chuma chi kweti luŋuku; mumatalenuejima mwakadyaŋa mankendi akadi iluŋi hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi watambikili awakulumpi ejima awaIsarela, wayilili nindi, Yenumwa kakwati anyana kanyikoku mwomweseka yisaka yenu, mwakajahipaseka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakanoni chiputa chanamutuntamu, mwakachi iŋŋi mumashiadi mumbashila, mwakasampwili nihachipamba chahewulu dachisu, nikuyipamba yamumbadi yiyedi yachisu, namashi adi mumbashila; wejimawenu bayi mwakedika muchisu chetala denu nakwidika hanzuku, chiŋa kunachi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova wakahita mwituŋa nakutapa aEjipitu; chaka monayi mashi nihachipamba chahewulu, nihayipamba yamumbadi, Yehova wakawutama hachisu, hakamwitŋa mukwakujila muna kwijila mu matalenu ayitapuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chumichi mwakachihembaŋa chakekali chidika chenu nichawa nyanenu haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakela, chimwakashika kwituŋa dakayinkayi Yehova mwomwayikaniniyi, mwakeli mudimu weniwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakela chakayilawu anyanenu nawu, Indi chimukwila mudimu iwumunatwali mudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enu kwenu mwakeh nenu, Tukuketula chimuna chapaseka yaYehova, wawutaminini hamatala awanyana kaIsarela muEjipitu, hatapiliyi aEjipitu, hapulwishiliyi mataletu. Antu anoŋamini nyitu yawu, nakudifukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela ayili, elili mwomwenomu mwalejeliyi Yehova aMosi naAroni, mwomweliluwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
